<body>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<b>Governor Kotek</b>,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Ten months ago, I provided comprehensive&nbsp;documentation of institutiona=
l abuse within Oregon State Parks' volunteer program.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Audio recordings. Video evidence. Contemporaneous emails. A complete eviden=
tiary record of supervisory misconduct, retaliation for protected speech, a=
nd systematic targeting of a volunteer offering unpaid labor to support Ore=
gon's public lands.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I reported this to Director Lisa Sumption with specific requests for accoun=
tability. She acknowledged receipt and deferred to &quot;appropriate channe=
ls.&quot; No investigation occurred. No protections were implemented. No ac=
countability was enforced.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I contacted your office multiple times. No response. Not even acknowledgmen=
t.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
For ten months, both you and Director Sumption have chosen silence.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
This silence is a choice. It is also evidence.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<b>Here is what the documentation shows</b>:</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Kati Baker, Park Supervisor at Honeyman State Park, orchestrated systematic=
 psychological pressure against me over two months. She weaponized manufact=
ured trust through a subordinate who extracted confidential disclosures und=
er false pretenses of friendship.
 Those disclosures were transmitted to supervisors who used them to constru=
ct a psychological profile framing my documented concerns as pathology.</di=
v>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Ryan Warren, Park Manager, executed that pressure through documented abuse =
including telling me to &quot;chew glass and swallow it&quot; while admitti=
ng I was &quot;never given the benefit of the doubt.&quot;</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Logan Bliss, Volunteer Services Lead, spent ninety minutes eliciting vulner=
ability through reciprocal disclosure, then betrayed that trust by transmit=
ting everything to supervisors who weaponized it against me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Allison Watson, Engagement Programs Manager, formalized my expulsion in wri=
ting, explicitly citing my protected First Amendment activity as grounds fo=
r removal.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
They deployed an unidentified operative to interrogate me while I worked al=
one. When I documented this encounter and reported it to Director Sumption,=
 she ignored it.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
They targeted every available classification: my economic precarity, my iso=
lation, my genuine care for the work, my trust in people who presented them=
selves as allies.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
And yes=97they targeted my identity. My supervisor told me they felt &quot;=
uncomfortable&quot; around me. Suggested I believed I had &quot;a future&qu=
ot; with a male colleague. Used my sexuality as one more tool to destabiliz=
e and discredit.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
But I am not just a gay volunteer. I am a person who came to Oregon's coast=
 to rebuild my life through service to public lands. I restructured everyth=
ing around that commitment. I offered my labor freely. I asked only for the=
 basic protections any volunteer
 deserves: safety from supervisory abuse and the right to report harm witho=
ut retaliation.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Instead, I was systematically targeted, dismissed six days before my schedu=
led completion, and permanently expelled from all Oregon State Parks progra=
ms for documenting what was done to me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<b><br>
</b></div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<b>I want to be clear about something:</b></div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
This is not about my identity. This is about institutional failure to prote=
ct any volunteer=97regardless of identity=97from documented supervisory abu=
se.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
But when a gay governor stays silent while a gay volunteer documents identi=
ty-based targeting by state employees, that silence has meaning.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
When your office receives comprehensive evidence of retaliation for protect=
ed speech and chooses not even to acknowledge it, that choice has consequen=
ces.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
When an institution charged with serving Oregon's public refuses to protect=
 the people who volunteer to support that mission, the institution has fail=
ed its purpose.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<b>They tried to break me</b>.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
They used my economic vulnerability. My isolation. My trust. My care for th=
e work. My sexuality. Every available tool to destabilize, discredit, and e=
xpel me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
They failed.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I documented everything. I built a permanent public archive. I am still her=
e=97on Oregon's coast, serving as a volunteer caretaker, thriving in the li=
fe they tried to take from me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
And for ten months, your administration has been silent.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<b>So I am asking you directly:</b></div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Does a volunteer who documented retaliation and identity-based targeting by=
 state employees deserve an independent investigation?</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Yes or no?</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Not procedural language. Not deference to appropriate channels. Not silence=
.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
An answer.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Because every day you choose silence, you choose to protect the people who =
caused this harm over the volunteer they targeted.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Every day Director Sumption fails to act, she confirms that Oregon State Pa=
rks will shield abusers rather than protect volunteers.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
Every day this continues, the next volunteer who reports abuse knows exactl=
y what to expect: institutional silence, retaliation for documentation, and=
 protection of those who harm them.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
This is not just about me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
This is about whether Oregon's institutions protect vulnerable people or pr=
otect themselves.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
You have the evidence. You have the authority. You have had ten months.</di=
v>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
What will you choose?</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
